WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.263
[♪ opening theme music playing]

2
00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.806
[bird screeching]

3
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.666
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

4
00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:45.295
[footsteps approaching]

5
00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:50.133
[♪ gentle music playing]

6
00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:21.123
I heard that you were injured.

7
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.543
I trust you've been treated?

8
00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:26.587
I was supposed to see the physician,

9
00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:29.506
but he was summoned by you, Your Majesty.

10
00:01:31.341 --> 00:01:32.467
Ah.

11
00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:35.012
It was for my shoulder.

12
00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:36.972
He examined it.

13
00:01:46.398 --> 00:01:47.816
[cutlery clinking]

14
00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.151
[clinking stops]

15
00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.155
Isn't it strange?

16
00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.366
This table feels longer today.

17
00:01:56.992 --> 00:01:58.160
[scoffs]

18
00:01:58.660 --> 00:01:59.661
Very strange.

19
00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:03.832
How is questioning
the assassin progressing?

20
00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:07.711
It's very serious,

21
00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.838
but you've been reticent.

22
00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:12.507
It's still ongoing.

23
00:02:15.927 --> 00:02:17.471
And the runaway slave?

24
00:02:20.349 --> 00:02:22.559
-[breathes deeply]
-[♪ tense music playing]

25
00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:27.606
How did you hear of that?

26
00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.360
Walls have ears…

27
00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:34.029
more so with all the walls in this palace.

28
00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:35.197
[scoffs]

29
00:02:36.615 --> 00:02:39.117
[Sovieshu]
I don't know what you've heard about it,

30
00:02:39.201 --> 00:02:41.161
but I was just aiding her,

31
00:02:41.244 --> 00:02:43.080
because she was gravely hurt.

32
00:02:43.664 --> 00:02:45.540
That's as I suspected.

33
00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:48.418
Because you have always been
a compassionate ruler.

34
00:02:48.502 --> 00:02:51.797
She might have had her ankle
broken by that trap without us.

35
00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.340
Poor little thing.

36
00:02:57.969 --> 00:03:01.556
Since you sent the Imperial Physician,
she'll be well soon.

37
00:03:08.522 --> 00:03:09.940
[cutlery clinks softly]

38
00:03:29.835 --> 00:03:31.336
Send that girl to my palace.

39
00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.924
I will care for her
until her wounds are better,

40
00:03:36.007 --> 00:03:37.050
then she'll be sent back.

41
00:03:37.134 --> 00:03:38.260
[Sovieshu] Enough about that.

42
00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:40.971
It's our time to dine together on our own.

43
00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.180
Let's talk of other things.

44
00:03:42.264 --> 00:03:44.599
Women can enter the royal palaces…

45
00:03:45.392 --> 00:03:47.144
if I grant consent.

46
00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:49.438
As you know,
this law stands for all women.

47
00:03:50.689 --> 00:03:51.940
A serving girl,

48
00:03:52.023 --> 00:03:53.066
a courtier…

49
00:03:55.026 --> 00:03:56.111
a mistress.

50
00:04:06.455 --> 00:04:07.789
A serving girl…

51
00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:10.709
a courtier…

52
00:04:15.547 --> 00:04:17.007
[exhales deeply]

53
00:04:18.675 --> 00:04:19.885
a mistress.

54
00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:29.853
Yes.

55
00:04:30.353 --> 00:04:31.897
We cannot break our traditions.

56
00:04:36.067 --> 00:04:37.319
[sighs]

57
00:04:48.079 --> 00:04:50.081
If a mistress needs your consent…

58
00:04:53.376 --> 00:04:54.628
then listen…

59
00:04:57.339 --> 00:04:59.466
that is what I ask you for.

60
00:05:17.818 --> 00:05:18.819
I forbid it.

61
00:05:18.902 --> 00:05:19.945
[♪ music intensifies]

62
00:05:21.404 --> 00:05:22.405
[sighs]

63
00:05:22.489 --> 00:05:23.532
Everybody, leave us.

64
00:05:31.289 --> 00:05:32.415
[door closes]

65
00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.173
That hunting trophy
Your Majesty brought back

66
00:05:40.799 --> 00:05:41.967
is a slave.

67
00:05:43.677 --> 00:05:45.220
She's not a trophy, she is a person.

68
00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:47.180
She's not a slave, she's Rashta.

69
00:05:47.264 --> 00:05:49.099
She has a name, you know.

70
00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:50.809
You say that Rashta's her name.

71
00:05:51.643 --> 00:05:52.936
No surname, I take it?

72
00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:54.938
Do you even know what house she's from?

73
00:05:56.439 --> 00:05:59.860
If you take in a girl like that,
there'll be no end to the gossiping.

74
00:06:02.612 --> 00:06:04.364
Do not go any further.

75
00:06:04.447 --> 00:06:05.699
You must expel her now.

76
00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:07.909
It really doesn't matter
what her surname is.

77
00:06:07.993 --> 00:06:09.077
[♪ music fades]

78
00:06:14.082 --> 00:06:16.209
Thanks to meeting that poor young girl,

79
00:06:18.587 --> 00:06:20.672
I felt my heart flutter at last.

80
00:06:27.304 --> 00:06:28.847
[♪ heartfelt sad music playing]

81
00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:29.973
"At last"?

82
00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:34.269
How could you tell me such a thing?

83
00:06:34.352 --> 00:06:37.981
I never thought a feeling like this could
take hold of me either.

84
00:06:49.826 --> 00:06:51.745
We should not be bickering about this.

85
00:06:51.828 --> 00:06:53.538
It will only make things worse for us.

86
00:06:58.168 --> 00:07:00.837
There will be nothing that changes
between you and me.

87
00:07:04.341 --> 00:07:05.967
No matter what happens,

88
00:07:08.303 --> 00:07:10.055
you are my only wife.

89
00:07:18.813 --> 00:07:20.982
That image of "you and me"
will be a facade.

90
00:07:24.069 --> 00:07:27.030
Our laws must be upheld
and respected by all.

91
00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:31.117
The presence of slaves
is strictly forbidden in the palace.

92
00:07:32.619 --> 00:07:34.537
If you want to make a mistress of her,

93
00:07:35.622 --> 00:07:37.415
then emancipation must be sought.

94
00:07:39.209 --> 00:07:40.627
Without evidence, I will not approve it.

95
00:07:44.506 --> 00:07:46.299
If you won't grant approval…

96
00:07:54.766 --> 00:07:56.476
then I'll just create a new law.

97
00:07:57.727 --> 00:07:59.729
[♪ dramatic music playing]

98
00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.423
[Marquess Lante] Your Majesty,
perhaps you should reconsider

99
00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:27.716
the matter of Ms. Rashta.

100
00:08:27.799 --> 00:08:29.634
Being a slave means
that she or one of her ancestors

101
00:08:29.718 --> 00:08:32.512
committed a crime grave enough
to warrant a life sentence.

102
00:08:32.595 --> 00:08:34.139
And what's more, since she's a runaway,

103
00:08:34.222 --> 00:08:37.851
she couldn't possibly be eligible
to be reviewed and granted emancipation.

104
00:08:37.934 --> 00:08:40.061
If that is the case,
I'll change that law as well.

105
00:08:42.105 --> 00:08:44.399
We don't know if she was kidnapped
by slave traders,

106
00:08:44.482 --> 00:08:47.610
or she may well even be
the daughter of an aristocrat,

107
00:08:47.694 --> 00:08:49.487
or a child who lost her way.

108
00:08:49.571 --> 00:08:51.531
Why would you be so blind

109
00:08:51.614 --> 00:08:54.492
as to think she was enslaved
for committing a crime?

110
00:08:55.076 --> 00:08:56.953
You saw her face, Marquess Lante.

111
00:08:57.454 --> 00:08:58.872
[chuckles softly]

112
00:08:58.955 --> 00:09:00.331
I ask you,

113
00:09:00.415 --> 00:09:02.292
could a slave have such beauty?

114
00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.712
-[chuckles softly]
-[♪ moody music playing]

115
00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.386
[door opens]

116
00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:15.138
[wind blows]

117
00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:17.140
[♪ music continues]

118
00:09:20.727 --> 00:09:21.936
[exhales sharply]

119
00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.627
Thanks to meeting that poor young girl,

120
00:09:47.837 --> 00:09:50.006
I felt my heart flutter at last.

121
00:09:53.718 --> 00:09:54.803
[Eliza] Your Majesty,

122
00:09:55.804 --> 00:09:57.388
you'll catch a cold like that.

123
00:09:59.265 --> 00:10:00.475
Leave it.

124
00:10:02.352 --> 00:10:04.145
I don't feel cold. I'm fine.

125
00:10:06.689 --> 00:10:08.149
[sighs heavily]

126
00:10:09.359 --> 00:10:11.361
[♪ gentle music playing]

127
00:10:29.546 --> 00:10:30.922
[knock on door]

128
00:10:34.384 --> 00:10:35.844
Your Majesty, I'm here!

129
00:10:42.433 --> 00:10:44.185
His Majesty commands your presence.

130
00:10:52.026 --> 00:10:53.194
[gasps]

131
00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:56.781
[Rashta gasps]

132
00:11:15.842 --> 00:11:16.968
[gasps softly]

133
00:11:19.262 --> 00:11:20.513
[breath trembling]

134
00:11:23.933 --> 00:11:25.393
Did your master do this?

135
00:11:38.656 --> 00:11:40.033
You said you'd ensure

136
00:11:41.117 --> 00:11:43.953
I was never put through
suffering again, Your Majesty.

137
00:11:45.288 --> 00:11:46.664
Did you mean it?

138
00:12:01.763 --> 00:12:03.681
-[slave exclaims]
-[Lotteshu] You slave brat. How dare you?

139
00:12:03.765 --> 00:12:05.558
Damn it! [grunts]

140
00:12:05.642 --> 00:12:07.560
-I'm a shit, am I? Huh?
-[slaves sobbing]

141
00:12:07.644 --> 00:12:09.229
Take that! Son of a bitch!

142
00:12:09.312 --> 00:12:11.064
-[henchman] Wait a minute.
-What's that?

143
00:12:11.731 --> 00:12:13.900
-What?
-Master, I think he's dead.

144
00:12:13.983 --> 00:12:16.527
Ah, you… you should've told me sooner.

145
00:12:16.611 --> 00:12:18.738
I've been beating a sodding dead man.

146
00:12:18.821 --> 00:12:20.031
[sighs]

147
00:12:20.114 --> 00:12:21.157
Ugh…

148
00:12:22.158 --> 00:12:24.369
-Let's do the rest tomorrow.
-[henchman] Yes, sir.

149
00:12:24.452 --> 00:12:27.121
Take this arsehole
and string him up in the square.

150
00:12:27.205 --> 00:12:28.998
He'll be a lesson
for the runaway bastards.

151
00:12:29.082 --> 00:12:30.583
-[slaves sobbing]
-God's sake!

152
00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:32.293
Be quiet, or I'll give you
something to cry about!

153
00:12:34.087 --> 00:12:36.214
And why haven't the men
caught that bloody girl?

154
00:12:36.297 --> 00:12:37.382
They should have come back.

155
00:12:37.465 --> 00:12:38.716
I'm sure they'll get her back, sir.

156
00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.885
-So you say.
-[henchman] Quiet!

157
00:12:41.511 --> 00:12:43.554
I think the bounty hunters are coming!

158
00:12:43.638 --> 00:12:44.806
Oh, good!

159
00:12:48.893 --> 00:12:50.353
Ah, they're here at last!

160
00:12:52.939 --> 00:12:54.774
Oh, it's the Emperor's men.

161
00:12:56.317 --> 00:12:57.485
What's this?

162
00:12:58.486 --> 00:12:59.696
Whose men?

163
00:13:06.119 --> 00:13:07.495
[horse neighs]

164
00:13:11.165 --> 00:13:12.709
Are you Viscount Lotteshu?

165
00:13:15.753 --> 00:13:16.754
Yes, I am.

166
00:13:16.838 --> 00:13:18.089
[groans in pain]

167
00:13:18.172 --> 00:13:20.925
[grunts] Sir!
I'm sure this is a misunder--

168
00:13:23.511 --> 00:13:25.763
The men you sent
entered the palace hunting grounds

169
00:13:25.847 --> 00:13:27.932
and attempted to assassinate the Emperor.

170
00:13:28.766 --> 00:13:31.102
It can't be.
My men weren't there. [whimpers]

171
00:13:32.312 --> 00:13:34.147
They confessed that they were paid by you!

172
00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.982
This must be a hideous mistake.

173
00:13:36.065 --> 00:13:38.192
I just sent the men after a runaway slave

174
00:13:38.276 --> 00:13:39.819
to capture her
and to bring the woman back.

175
00:13:39.902 --> 00:13:42.030
-You bastard!
-[Marquess Lante] Stop there.

176
00:13:42.113 --> 00:13:43.656
[Lotteshu sobs]

177
00:13:52.457 --> 00:13:54.459
[breath trembling]

178
00:14:03.051 --> 00:14:04.635
[cell door shuts]

179
00:14:05.219 --> 00:14:06.596
You know who's addressing you?

180
00:14:06.679 --> 00:14:08.181
[voice trembling] Your… Majesty.

181
00:14:08.264 --> 00:14:11.392
Please! It must be just a…
all a kind of awful mix-up.

182
00:14:11.476 --> 00:14:13.269
I know of your kind.

183
00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:16.064
Your father, his father,
and his father as well.

184
00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:19.275
Your lot has bought and sold people
for generations.

185
00:14:19.358 --> 00:14:22.570
And while my army and I
shed our blood in the war,

186
00:14:22.653 --> 00:14:25.073
you vile creatures grew fat,

187
00:14:25.156 --> 00:14:27.200
chasing after the scraps of death.

188
00:14:27.283 --> 00:14:29.327
Did you not take children

189
00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.829
and then trade them as slaves
with outlawed pirates?

190
00:14:31.913 --> 00:14:33.956
Ah! Oh no, my lord, not ever, my lord!

191
00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.833
I… I just wanted to catch the girl.

192
00:14:35.917 --> 00:14:37.585
I'd already signed a contract.

193
00:14:37.668 --> 00:14:39.337
It was with a tavern in the port city,

194
00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:42.215
but because that ungrateful bitch
ran away, I lost…

195
00:14:43.549 --> 00:14:44.926
Open your eyes.

196
00:14:45.009 --> 00:14:46.594
[sobbing]

197
00:14:51.224 --> 00:14:52.558
Do you know what this is?

198
00:14:53.434 --> 00:14:54.602
A slave contract, my lord.

199
00:14:54.685 --> 00:14:56.479
No, it isn't that at all.

200
00:14:57.188 --> 00:14:58.648
It is evidence in fact.

201
00:14:58.731 --> 00:15:00.775
Every one of your crimes is written on it.

202
00:15:00.858 --> 00:15:03.736
I could punish you for any one
of these offenses, could I not?

203
00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:07.073
Yes. Every crime I've committed
is on that page.

204
00:15:10.493 --> 00:15:12.411
What should we do with him?

205
00:15:13.121 --> 00:15:14.580
I think you should decide.

206
00:15:20.503 --> 00:15:22.505
[♪ foreboding music playing]

207
00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:29.971
[gasps]

208
00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.311
Do not be afraid.

209
00:15:38.688 --> 00:15:40.022
I'm right here with you.

210
00:15:43.734 --> 00:15:46.571
Now I think this bastard
should be punished.

211
00:15:46.654 --> 00:15:48.197
I could make him into a slave,

212
00:15:49.407 --> 00:15:53.286
or I could have his arms and legs
torn off his body one by one.

213
00:15:55.204 --> 00:15:56.747
[Rashta screaming]

214
00:16:00.168 --> 00:16:02.086
-[whip lashing]
-[Rashta screaming]

215
00:16:04.255 --> 00:16:06.716
[sobbing, panting weakly]

216
00:16:15.516 --> 00:16:17.059
I gladly accept any punishment.

217
00:16:17.143 --> 00:16:19.270
Even if you tear off my arms and legs,

218
00:16:19.353 --> 00:16:21.689
it won't erase my crimes, Your Majesty.

219
00:16:21.772 --> 00:16:22.982
[stammers] But… But…

220
00:16:23.065 --> 00:16:24.483
if I have one wish…

221
00:16:24.567 --> 00:16:25.902
my Rashta…

222
00:16:25.985 --> 00:16:28.196
No, no, not mine. I mean, Lady Rashta!

223
00:16:28.279 --> 00:16:30.698
I want to ask for her forgiveness.

224
00:16:36.871 --> 00:16:38.080
Rashta.

225
00:16:38.581 --> 00:16:40.666
Never let that name
pass your lips ever again.

226
00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:44.253
Disobey me, and I will have
your entire family erased.

227
00:16:44.337 --> 00:16:45.922
Yes, I understand.

228
00:16:46.005 --> 00:16:47.882
It will never pass my lips again.

229
00:16:49.258 --> 00:16:51.385
Mark him in some way
to remind him of this always.

230
00:16:56.224 --> 00:16:57.975
[whimpering]

231
00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:06.651
-[squelches]
-[Lotteshu screaming]

232
00:17:11.656 --> 00:17:13.199
[breathing shakily]

233
00:17:22.833 --> 00:17:24.460
[gasps softly]

234
00:17:25.336 --> 00:17:27.421
[♪ enchanting music playing]

235
00:17:36.764 --> 00:17:37.765
[gasps]

236
00:17:39.892 --> 00:17:41.102
I trust you slept well?

237
00:17:44.438 --> 00:17:45.690
Where is this?

238
00:17:46.399 --> 00:17:47.650
What is this?

239
00:17:47.733 --> 00:17:49.902
This chamber is the Rose Room,

240
00:17:50.736 --> 00:17:52.321
which will now be yours.

241
00:17:52.405 --> 00:17:53.531
[gasps]

242
00:18:08.462 --> 00:18:10.506
[♪ enchanting music continues]

243
00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:16.971
It's lovely.

244
00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.182
Do you really mean
this room is all for me?

245
00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.104
[Marquess Lante] If you need anything,
or if you're not comfortable,

246
00:18:26.022 --> 00:18:27.565
just tell these maids-in-waiting.

247
00:18:27.648 --> 00:18:29.900
[both] It's our honor
to serve you, my lady.

248
00:18:32.862 --> 00:18:34.322
Go and tell His Majesty she's awake.

249
00:18:34.905 --> 00:18:36.157
Yes, sir.

250
00:18:37.325 --> 00:18:38.868
[Kisia giggles]

251
00:18:39.535 --> 00:18:40.536
[mouths] Now?

252
00:18:42.163 --> 00:18:43.623
Oh. Now!

253
00:19:11.067 --> 00:19:13.235
I really love it, Your Majesty.

254
00:19:16.322 --> 00:19:17.573
You're better now you've rested?

255
00:19:19.867 --> 00:19:20.868
You can leave us.

256
00:19:24.914 --> 00:19:26.457
I brought you a gift.

257
00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.335
You've been so… so generous.

258
00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:34.173
It's a dream already
just being by your side, Your Majesty.

259
00:19:34.882 --> 00:19:35.883
It's true.

260
00:19:40.346 --> 00:19:41.639
Thank you.

261
00:19:41.722 --> 00:19:43.099
What is this?

262
00:19:45.184 --> 00:19:46.686
A slave certificate.

263
00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:48.562
The one signed for you.

264
00:19:51.399 --> 00:19:54.068
SLAVE CERTIFICATE PURCHASER:
VISCOUNT LOTTESHU RIMWELL

265
00:19:54.151 --> 00:19:55.194
SLAVE NAME RASHTA

266
00:19:56.779 --> 00:19:58.280
Your… Majesty.

267
00:19:58.364 --> 00:19:59.865
You are no longer

268
00:20:00.574 --> 00:20:02.201
a slave to anyone.

269
00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:11.627
Let this erase the past.

270
00:20:12.378 --> 00:20:13.671
It's all gone now.

271
00:20:22.847 --> 00:20:24.432
[sobbing]

272
00:20:39.822 --> 00:20:41.699
Lady Laura! Viscountess Verdi!

273
00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.243
-[Annie] Did you hear?
-[Verdi and Laura] What?

274
00:20:44.326 --> 00:20:46.704
[Annie] Apparently,
His Majesty entered the Rose Room

275
00:20:46.787 --> 00:20:48.205
but he has not come out since Monday.

276
00:20:48.289 --> 00:20:49.457
[gasps]

277
00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:51.751
-Once any man's mind is lost to a lover…
-Huh?

278
00:20:51.834 --> 00:20:53.002
…he's beyond help then.

279
00:20:53.085 --> 00:20:54.378
Laura!

280
00:20:55.045 --> 00:20:56.922
I didn't say who I meant, did I?

281
00:20:57.006 --> 00:20:58.632
Mmm. Just observing.

282
00:20:58.716 --> 00:20:59.967
Well, there's that story

283
00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.594
that the Rose Room has been cursed,
isn't there?

284
00:21:01.677 --> 00:21:03.304
-Did you know?
-It's cursed?

285
00:21:03.387 --> 00:21:06.307
They say it was cursed
by the old Late Dowager Empress.

286
00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:08.434
Knowing what a womanizer
the late emperor was,

287
00:21:08.517 --> 00:21:10.728
the rumors were always certain
to go around the whole court.

288
00:21:10.811 --> 00:21:12.938
Yes, but, out of all those girls,

289
00:21:13.022 --> 00:21:15.733
I'm sure the Rose Room's never had
to house a runaway slave.

290
00:21:15.816 --> 00:21:17.026
-Ah!
-You behave!

291
00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:18.861
Lady Laura, you be careful.

292
00:21:18.944 --> 00:21:20.237
Do you want trouble?

293
00:21:20.321 --> 00:21:23.491
His Majesty has proclaimed
we'll be punished for saying those words.

294
00:21:23.574 --> 00:21:25.868
We mustn't be caught
saying "runaway slave."

295
00:21:25.951 --> 00:21:27.953
You… babies.

296
00:21:28.037 --> 00:21:30.206
Runaway slave! Runaway slave!

297
00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:31.373
[scoffs]

298
00:21:31.457 --> 00:21:32.583
Honestly…

299
00:21:33.083 --> 00:21:34.543
what am I supposed
to call a runaway slave,

300
00:21:34.627 --> 00:21:36.295
if not a runaway slave?

301
00:21:36.378 --> 00:21:37.546
[gasps]

302
00:21:42.468 --> 00:21:44.512
She's not a slave, she's a commoner.

303
00:21:46.722 --> 00:21:49.809
From what I hear,
His Majesty summoned the girl's master

304
00:21:49.892 --> 00:21:51.435
and had him beaten to a bloody pulp.

305
00:21:51.519 --> 00:21:52.520
Shh!

306
00:21:55.231 --> 00:21:58.234
The rumors that she was a runaway slave
are not just idle talk.

307
00:21:58.943 --> 00:22:00.736
Rashta's not bound as a slave.

308
00:22:01.987 --> 00:22:05.950
His Majesty has said she's not,
and it must therefore be true.

309
00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:10.704
-Yes.
-Yes.

310
00:22:10.788 --> 00:22:13.249
This is the list of guests
Your Majesty will be receiving.

311
00:22:13.332 --> 00:22:16.293
Please pay special attention
to my guests from the Southern Kingdom.

312
00:22:16.377 --> 00:22:17.586
Yes.

313
00:22:22.091 --> 00:22:23.551
That's the Western Kingdom.

314
00:22:23.634 --> 00:22:25.177
Why is the Emperor
not welcoming their king?

315
00:22:25.261 --> 00:22:27.012
We have made adjustments,

316
00:22:27.096 --> 00:22:28.973
as Prince Heinrey,
the king's younger brother,

317
00:22:29.056 --> 00:22:30.224
will be attending in his stead.

318
00:22:30.307 --> 00:22:31.642
But no need to feel burdened by that.

319
00:22:31.725 --> 00:22:35.229
Rumor has it he is far from capable
of discussing affairs of state.

320
00:22:35.312 --> 00:22:36.814
Yes, I've heard reports.

321
00:22:36.897 --> 00:22:39.024
He's been famous
for quite a lot of exploits, sir.

322
00:22:39.108 --> 00:22:41.610
Yet, the power and wealth
the Western Kingdom holds

323
00:22:41.694 --> 00:22:43.696
is in no way inferior to our own.

324
00:22:43.779 --> 00:22:45.364
We must not forget its importance.

325
00:22:45.447 --> 00:22:47.324
Yes, Your Majesty.

326
00:22:51.495 --> 00:22:53.497
-[door closes]
-So will we finally see

327
00:22:53.581 --> 00:22:54.999
this prince we've heard about?

328
00:22:55.082 --> 00:22:56.625
The rumors can't all be true.

329
00:22:57.209 --> 00:23:00.462
His dreamy eyes
can draw you in just like magic.

330
00:23:00.546 --> 00:23:03.883
[Laura] I heard he's a real ladies' man,
and a total narcissist,

331
00:23:03.966 --> 00:23:06.385
and they say that he hangs around
with some pirates as well.

332
00:23:06.468 --> 00:23:09.889
The stories I know about Prince Heinrey
are rather different.

333
00:23:10.514 --> 00:23:12.099
Would you tell us
what you know of him, please.

334
00:23:12.182 --> 00:23:14.435
[Artina] Of course. Thanks to Sir Kosair,

335
00:23:14.518 --> 00:23:17.021
in the West, there were just
a few Springwater Bandits

336
00:23:17.104 --> 00:23:18.772
and they entered
the Western Kingdom's lands.

337
00:23:19.565 --> 00:23:20.649
[barmaid screams]

338
00:23:20.733 --> 00:23:22.860
[Artina] They raided a border village
in the Western Kingdom.

339
00:23:22.943 --> 00:23:24.403
-Get over here.
-[bandits laugh]

340
00:23:24.486 --> 00:23:25.821
[barmaid 1 whimpering]

341
00:23:27.489 --> 00:23:29.033
[barmaid 2 screaming]

342
00:23:30.117 --> 00:23:31.285
[bandit 1] Trample them!

343
00:23:32.745 --> 00:23:33.954
Ah! [whimpers]

344
00:23:36.248 --> 00:23:37.583
[Artina] But then,

345
00:23:37.666 --> 00:23:39.460
Prince Heinrey and a single attendant,

346
00:23:39.543 --> 00:23:41.462
who were just about to cross the border,

347
00:23:41.545 --> 00:23:42.963
happened to encounter them.

348
00:23:45.758 --> 00:23:48.218
[♪ heroic music playing]

349
00:23:51.013 --> 00:23:52.306
[bandit 2] Who are you?

350
00:23:53.390 --> 00:23:54.433
[Heinrey] Me?

351
00:23:56.477 --> 00:23:58.771
I'm Heinrey of the Western Kingdom.

352
00:23:58.854 --> 00:24:00.147
[♪ music intensifies]

353
00:24:03.025 --> 00:24:04.318
[bandits yelling]

354
00:24:07.905 --> 00:24:09.490
-[bandit grunts]
-[Heinrey grunts]

355
00:24:12.701 --> 00:24:13.786
[yelling]

356
00:24:15.663 --> 00:24:17.456
-[groaning]
-[grunting]

357
00:24:24.296 --> 00:24:25.381
[grunting]

358
00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:44.525
[bandit yells]

359
00:24:52.116 --> 00:24:53.659
[bandit grunts]

360
00:25:02.292 --> 00:25:04.378
[bandit grunting]

361
00:25:04.461 --> 00:25:06.922
[bandit whimpering]

362
00:25:10.843 --> 00:25:11.885
[Heinrey] Well then…

363
00:25:11.969 --> 00:25:13.762
What would you like to drink, sir?
It's on me.

364
00:25:14.638 --> 00:25:16.598
Oh, no alcohol, please.

365
00:25:16.682 --> 00:25:18.058
One glass of milk, thank you.

366
00:25:20.352 --> 00:25:22.521
[Laura] So he took down 30 men?

367
00:25:22.604 --> 00:25:24.815
Prince Heinrey did? All by himself?

368
00:25:25.524 --> 00:25:26.692
[Artina] Plus one other.

369
00:25:26.775 --> 00:25:28.152
His attendant.

370
00:25:30.946 --> 00:25:31.947
[Verdi and Laura sigh]

371
00:25:32.573 --> 00:25:35.909
[giggles] He's even good at fighting, too!

372
00:25:36.410 --> 00:25:37.619
[bird chirps]

373
00:25:38.370 --> 00:25:40.456
-[gasps]
-[taps on glass]

374
00:25:41.540 --> 00:25:44.585
[♪ enchanting music playing]

375
00:25:51.216 --> 00:25:52.342
[bird chirps]

376
00:25:52.426 --> 00:25:53.886
-Oh!
-[all gasp]

377
00:25:53.969 --> 00:25:56.346
[Laura] Oh! Is that a bird?
Where's it going?

378
00:25:56.430 --> 00:25:58.932
-[Verdi gasps] Oh! What's it doing here?
-[exclaims]

379
00:26:00.684 --> 00:26:01.977
[Laura] Oh! Goodness me!

380
00:26:02.061 --> 00:26:03.687
-Oh my!
-Oh!

381
00:26:11.236 --> 00:26:12.488
[bird chirps]

382
00:26:15.908 --> 00:26:17.451
What's this bird doing here?

383
00:26:17.534 --> 00:26:19.536
I know this bird. We've made friends.

384
00:26:20.913 --> 00:26:22.122
Right?

385
00:26:23.373 --> 00:26:24.750
[chirps]

386
00:26:24.833 --> 00:26:25.918
[Navier laughs]

387
00:26:27.336 --> 00:26:28.545
[chirps]

388
00:26:28.629 --> 00:26:30.547
What kind of bird is this?

389
00:26:30.631 --> 00:26:33.926
At the hunting grounds
I swear I saw a similar bird.

390
00:26:34.635 --> 00:26:36.428
It has to be quite rare.

391
00:26:36.512 --> 00:26:38.263
[laughs] How fascinating.

392
00:26:38.347 --> 00:26:40.557
[Verdi] It looks like
it's used to human hands.

393
00:26:40.641 --> 00:26:42.643
Its feathers are well cared for, too.

394
00:26:42.726 --> 00:26:44.394
[chuckles] He's friendly.

395
00:26:44.478 --> 00:26:45.521
Hi, little one.

396
00:26:45.604 --> 00:26:46.980
-[bird shrieks]
-[Verdi exclaims]

397
00:26:47.064 --> 00:26:48.649
[Eliza] Oh!

398
00:26:48.732 --> 00:26:51.902
So, the bird just prefers
Your Majesty, then.

399
00:26:51.985 --> 00:26:53.821
You came with another letter today.

400
00:26:55.155 --> 00:26:57.449
[gasps] Who has been sending letters?

401
00:26:58.575 --> 00:26:59.993
It's a mystery.

402
00:27:03.622 --> 00:27:04.623
[Verdi] We're so curious.

403
00:27:05.290 --> 00:27:07.334
Please, would you read it to us as well?

404
00:27:10.546 --> 00:27:12.548
[Navier] "I am a guest on my way
to the Eastern Empire

405
00:27:12.631 --> 00:27:14.716
"to attend the New Year's Celebration.

406
00:27:14.800 --> 00:27:18.345
"I chanced upon a field of beautiful
purple flowers on my journey

407
00:27:18.428 --> 00:27:20.139
"and decided to rest there for a day.

408
00:27:20.222 --> 00:27:24.893
"Now my 'fate' is safely making
its way toward its objective,

409
00:27:24.977 --> 00:27:26.520
"so please be reassured.

410
00:27:27.980 --> 00:27:29.147
"Lastly,

411
00:27:29.731 --> 00:27:31.692
"do you know the name of this flower?"

412
00:27:32.943 --> 00:27:35.195
[gasps] Wisteria, I'm certain!

413
00:27:35.279 --> 00:27:38.365
There's a field of Wisteria
near Mons Harbor!

414
00:27:38.448 --> 00:27:41.118
Your Majesty's family is
from Mons Harbor, isn't it?

415
00:27:41.743 --> 00:27:43.161
[inhales]

416
00:27:49.209 --> 00:27:50.419
Hello.

417
00:27:50.502 --> 00:27:52.588
Did you come all the way to give me this?

418
00:27:52.671 --> 00:27:53.797
[chirps]

419
00:27:53.881 --> 00:27:55.507
You've come quite a distance.

420
00:27:55.591 --> 00:27:56.592
[chirps]

421
00:27:58.635 --> 00:28:00.304
[all chuckling]

422
00:28:01.013 --> 00:28:03.348
[Verdi] Look at it
gulping down that water.

423
00:28:03.432 --> 00:28:05.183
-[Verdi laughs]
-Its journey must have been difficult.

424
00:28:05.267 --> 00:28:08.186
[Laura] What country do you think
this guest is from?

425
00:28:12.232 --> 00:28:13.817
-Is it that good?
-Hmm.

426
00:28:14.318 --> 00:28:16.987
Everything in the palace
tastes so wonderful.

427
00:28:17.070 --> 00:28:19.489
-[♪ gentle music playing]
-The fruit,

428
00:28:19.573 --> 00:28:20.782
the chocolate,

429
00:28:20.866 --> 00:28:21.992
the vegetable soup,

430
00:28:22.075 --> 00:28:23.535
the meat and the cookies…

431
00:28:23.619 --> 00:28:26.622
Even the water's perfect.
It's so delicious! It's so fresh!

432
00:28:26.705 --> 00:28:28.165
[laughing]

433
00:28:31.710 --> 00:28:33.921
What do you do with yourself
while I am away?

434
00:28:34.004 --> 00:28:36.465
Hmm. Mostly, I think of you.

435
00:28:37.174 --> 00:28:38.216
Hmm…

436
00:28:38.926 --> 00:28:40.886
And the view is lovely.

437
00:28:42.471 --> 00:28:45.349
I've been enjoying
watching people from the window.

438
00:28:47.851 --> 00:28:50.729
I wonder what they've said
when I see them all laughing.

439
00:28:50.812 --> 00:28:52.814
Those elegant ladies…

440
00:28:52.898 --> 00:28:54.733
They make such pretty expressions.

441
00:28:56.026 --> 00:28:59.154
Do they all learn about expressions, too?

442
00:29:00.364 --> 00:29:01.365
Of course.

443
00:29:02.366 --> 00:29:03.617
You mean it?

444
00:29:04.826 --> 00:29:06.328
Rashta wants to learn as well.

445
00:29:07.329 --> 00:29:08.330
No chance.

446
00:29:08.413 --> 00:29:10.457
[cutely] Why no?

447
00:29:10.540 --> 00:29:12.250
You don't need to learn anything.

448
00:29:12.793 --> 00:29:14.544
You're already lovable

449
00:29:15.045 --> 00:29:16.129
just as you are.

450
00:29:18.382 --> 00:29:19.716
[Rashta chuckles]

451
00:29:20.425 --> 00:29:21.718
Is the Empress nice?

452
00:29:24.137 --> 00:29:25.263
Is she always smiling?

453
00:29:30.519 --> 00:29:32.354
[♪ music continues]

454
00:29:43.115 --> 00:29:44.116
[chirps]

455
00:29:45.993 --> 00:29:48.036
[Navier] "The letter brought by the bird

456
00:29:49.246 --> 00:29:51.164
"carried the fragrance of my childhood.

457
00:29:54.251 --> 00:29:57.170
"The flower is called wisteria.

458
00:29:58.213 --> 00:30:02.551
"It needs a certain soil and climate,
so it cannot be grown in other regions.

459
00:30:05.303 --> 00:30:09.558
"To the accidental 'fate' that sent me
such a beautiful memory…

460
00:30:12.227 --> 00:30:13.937
"my endless gratitude."

461
00:30:16.189 --> 00:30:18.483
If a noble young lady is like that,

462
00:30:19.443 --> 00:30:23.780
how elegant
Her Highness' expressions must be.

463
00:30:24.698 --> 00:30:26.158
Is she always smiling?

464
00:30:26.908 --> 00:30:30.495
I imagine her being
so beautiful and so refined.

465
00:30:32.080 --> 00:30:33.915
If you get a bit bored,

466
00:30:33.999 --> 00:30:36.543
why don't you go outside
and play in the garden?

467
00:30:37.127 --> 00:30:38.420
Can I do that?

468
00:30:38.503 --> 00:30:39.629
Yes, of course.

469
00:30:39.713 --> 00:30:41.131
[Rashta chuckles softly]

470
00:30:41.214 --> 00:30:44.426
Lante said to me,
"Make sure you don't roam around outside."

471
00:30:45.052 --> 00:30:46.261
Oh, did he?

472
00:30:46.344 --> 00:30:47.554
[Rashta] Mmm.

473
00:30:51.475 --> 00:30:53.226
[♪ gentle music playing]

474
00:30:53.310 --> 00:30:54.394
[Sovieshu moans]

475
00:31:09.409 --> 00:31:10.827
[inhales]

476
00:31:17.084 --> 00:31:18.085
[Navier] "P.S.

477
00:31:18.168 --> 00:31:22.339
"Come to think of it, the bird's eyes
are the same purple as the flower petals.

478
00:31:24.424 --> 00:31:25.926
"What is the bird's name?"

479
00:31:28.970 --> 00:31:30.430
[door closes]

480
00:31:41.817 --> 00:31:45.779
Is the Emperor
going to spend the night with that woman?

481
00:31:49.574 --> 00:31:51.076
And you let his staff know

482
00:31:51.868 --> 00:31:54.246
that it is my cycle's fertile window?

483
00:31:55.705 --> 00:31:56.748
Yes.

484
00:32:00.710 --> 00:32:02.129
Well, never mind.

485
00:32:02.212 --> 00:32:03.672
If you'd like to get changed,

486
00:32:04.297 --> 00:32:05.966
the maids-in-waiting can help you.

487
00:32:07.175 --> 00:32:08.426
A little later.

488
00:32:18.854 --> 00:32:20.814
[Eliza] Please, allow me, Your Majesty.

489
00:32:26.069 --> 00:32:29.781
My daughters still ask me
to brush their hair

490
00:32:29.865 --> 00:32:31.658
when they pay a visit

491
00:32:31.741 --> 00:32:33.743
since my hands attend to Your Majesty.

492
00:32:34.369 --> 00:32:35.912
They may be older now,

493
00:32:35.996 --> 00:32:38.874
but they are still very precious
and sacred hands.

494
00:32:42.085 --> 00:32:43.670
This is so soothing.

495
00:32:44.504 --> 00:32:46.298
[♪ moody music playing]

496
00:32:50.010 --> 00:32:51.052
Tell me…

497
00:32:52.679 --> 00:32:56.099
You've been with your husband a while.
Are you still in love?

498
00:32:58.226 --> 00:32:59.227
Hmm…

499
00:33:00.812 --> 00:33:03.315
We do still love each other.

500
00:33:05.734 --> 00:33:07.360
I've never felt this before.

501
00:33:08.069 --> 00:33:09.905
I've found myself wondering…

502
00:33:12.991 --> 00:33:15.243
is the Emperor who I truly love?

503
00:33:15.827 --> 00:33:17.037
I had never felt…

504
00:33:18.496 --> 00:33:20.415
certain about his love for me,

505
00:33:22.000 --> 00:33:24.127
though he gave me
no reason to question it.

506
00:33:25.545 --> 00:33:26.755
And yet…

507
00:33:29.007 --> 00:33:30.467
my heart's been aching.

508
00:33:41.603 --> 00:33:43.688
An unexplored passion can make fire…

509
00:33:44.272 --> 00:33:46.233
then it burns out all the more rapidly.

510
00:33:47.067 --> 00:33:51.196
Besides, she cannot even be accepted
into the Imperial Palace.

511
00:33:51.279 --> 00:33:55.533
Your Majesty, think of it
as though it is just a fleeting cloud.

512
00:34:05.043 --> 00:34:06.795
[exhales softly]

513
00:34:06.878 --> 00:34:09.422
[laughter]

514
00:34:09.506 --> 00:34:11.383
Isn't that just great, Mother?

515
00:34:11.466 --> 00:34:14.469
Oh, dear! They say she was all excited,

516
00:34:14.552 --> 00:34:16.554
spruced up and waiting for her husband,

517
00:34:16.638 --> 00:34:18.390
-who had gone to…
-[both laughing]

518
00:34:18.473 --> 00:34:20.809
…crawl into another bed
with a different girl!

519
00:34:20.892 --> 00:34:22.227
[both laughing]

520
00:34:22.310 --> 00:34:25.480
Oh, good heavens! That haughty bitch
is about to share her husband,

521
00:34:25.563 --> 00:34:29.317
not even with a commoner, no,
it's even better, she's just a slave girl!

522
00:34:29.401 --> 00:34:31.236
[both laughing]

523
00:34:31.319 --> 00:34:33.071
[sighs in satisfaction] So…

524
00:34:33.655 --> 00:34:35.448
what's the mood like in the palace?

525
00:34:35.532 --> 00:34:36.741
Inside, she's furious.

526
00:34:36.825 --> 00:34:38.785
And, Mother,
there's not a thing she can do.

527
00:34:38.868 --> 00:34:41.413
With her sense of pride,
would she grab the Emperor by the hair?

528
00:34:41.496 --> 00:34:43.790
-Or would she scratch his face?
-[chuckles]

529
00:34:43.873 --> 00:34:45.625
[laughs] And that would be
quite a sight to see!

530
00:34:46.209 --> 00:34:49.254
It looks like
His Highness has been enchanted by her.

531
00:34:49.337 --> 00:34:50.755
Mmm-hmm.

532
00:34:51.256 --> 00:34:53.800
Our plan to get one of our girls in there,

533
00:34:53.883 --> 00:34:55.302
we should put that on hold.

534
00:34:56.261 --> 00:34:58.096
You believe
he won't just enjoy her for a while,

535
00:34:58.179 --> 00:34:59.681
then dispose of her?

536
00:34:59.764 --> 00:35:02.892
I heard that the truth is he's desperate
to formally make her his mistress

537
00:35:02.976 --> 00:35:04.728
so he's trying to change the law.

538
00:35:04.811 --> 00:35:05.812
My word!

539
00:35:05.895 --> 00:35:08.273
Her Highness said
no person without an identity

540
00:35:08.356 --> 00:35:09.858
could be allowed to stay.

541
00:35:09.941 --> 00:35:12.527
And that's still the opinion
of the High Justices.

542
00:35:12.611 --> 00:35:14.613
Totally opposed.

543
00:35:15.196 --> 00:35:18.116
Since she's a slave,
she could be moved on without a family?

544
00:35:18.199 --> 00:35:19.618
Mmm-hmm.

545
00:35:19.701 --> 00:35:21.911
[♪ ominous music playing]

546
00:35:21.995 --> 00:35:23.997
But perhaps it might not need to change.

547
00:35:25.582 --> 00:35:26.583
Huh?

548
00:35:26.666 --> 00:35:30.837
All I'm saying is we should
scratch an itch on His Highness' back.

549
00:35:30.920 --> 00:35:32.213
You scratch mine…

550
00:35:32.964 --> 00:35:35.425
Yes. I told her to avoid going out

551
00:35:35.508 --> 00:35:38.094
and coming into contact with people
as much as possible, sire.

552
00:35:39.471 --> 00:35:40.472
Why's that?

553
00:35:40.555 --> 00:35:43.099
She's new and maybe hasn't learned
our rules by now.

554
00:35:43.183 --> 00:35:47.103
If she made a mistake
and became the subject of gossip, then…

555
00:35:47.979 --> 00:35:50.440
the palace could find itself
in a tough position.

556
00:35:51.900 --> 00:35:57.489
There are no rules or any etiquette
to teach a slave-born nobody, then?

557
00:35:58.657 --> 00:35:59.824
[gulping nervously]

558
00:35:59.908 --> 00:36:02.035
[♪ serious music playing]

559
00:36:04.996 --> 00:36:08.541
I should say, you still have
some visitors and appointments, sire.

560
00:36:08.625 --> 00:36:09.751
Are you ready?

561
00:36:13.880 --> 00:36:16.841
Your Majesty,
Lady Albani has requested an audience.

562
00:36:19.010 --> 00:36:20.428
What business has she here?

563
00:36:20.512 --> 00:36:22.472
Bothering His Majesty
with her grievances again?

564
00:36:27.686 --> 00:36:28.687
Please enter.

565
00:36:28.770 --> 00:36:30.772
[♪ dramatic music playing]

566
00:36:44.953 --> 00:36:46.454
[inaudible]

567
00:36:49.582 --> 00:36:51.042
[♪ music intensifies]

568
00:36:55.338 --> 00:36:56.506
[Eliza] Yes, of course.

569
00:37:01.302 --> 00:37:02.721
A messenger came from the East Palace.

570
00:37:02.804 --> 00:37:06.725
His Highness hopes Rashta will get
a registration as his mistress quite soon.

571
00:37:06.808 --> 00:37:07.934
[Laura gasps]

572
00:37:12.981 --> 00:37:14.983
[♪ tense music playing]

573
00:37:22.157 --> 00:37:23.575
What on earth has happened?

574
00:37:23.658 --> 00:37:26.911
We all thought she could never
be registered as a mistress.

575
00:37:32.083 --> 00:37:35.044
REQUEST TO REGISTER RASHTA
OF HOUSE BOTULIN AS IMPERIAL MISTRESS

576
00:37:37.672 --> 00:37:39.466
They've requested a review,

577
00:37:39.549 --> 00:37:41.009
now they've met the conditions.

578
00:37:43.136 --> 00:37:45.472
A family has decided
to adopt Rashta, it says.

579
00:37:45.555 --> 00:37:47.307
MISS RASHTA OF THE BOTULIN FAMILY

580
00:37:47.390 --> 00:37:49.225
It's Lady Albani's family.

581
00:37:50.643 --> 00:37:52.937
This will mean that
she will now be legitimate.

582
00:37:53.021 --> 00:37:54.439
-[Laura gasps]
-Good heavens!

583
00:37:54.522 --> 00:37:56.691
They would do this to make that slave…

584
00:38:02.614 --> 00:38:03.656
Say that I'll sign it.

585
00:38:03.740 --> 00:38:05.200
Your Majesty!

586
00:38:05.283 --> 00:38:06.910
If she is in the Botulin family,

587
00:38:08.119 --> 00:38:10.079
there's no grounds for me to oppose it.

588
00:38:10.830 --> 00:38:11.956
But it's so…

589
00:38:12.916 --> 00:38:14.584
Let's not let this upset us.

590
00:38:15.668 --> 00:38:17.128
Focus on the party instead.

591
00:38:17.212 --> 00:38:18.421
We will be celebrating

592
00:38:18.505 --> 00:38:21.132
the Eastern Empire's
100 years of greatness.

593
00:38:22.300 --> 00:38:23.927
We don't want to make any mistakes.

594
00:38:24.511 --> 00:38:25.512
-Yes, Majesty.
-Yes, Majesty.

595
00:38:30.850 --> 00:38:32.602
[Navier] Draft the contract clauses.

596
00:38:38.983 --> 00:38:40.902
I will discuss it with the Marquess.

597
00:38:40.985 --> 00:38:42.487
[♪ pensive music playing]

598
00:38:49.452 --> 00:38:50.495
This is absurd!

599
00:38:50.578 --> 00:38:51.830
What is His Majesty thinking?

600
00:38:51.913 --> 00:38:54.040
Does he really want to reconcile
with his uncle's family

601
00:38:54.123 --> 00:38:55.291
to give that girl status?

602
00:38:55.375 --> 00:38:57.710
Lower your voice,
His Majesty will hear you.

603
00:38:57.794 --> 00:39:00.004
Their intentions are perfectly clear.

604
00:39:00.088 --> 00:39:03.049
They will try to milk their association
with Rashta for all it's worth.

605
00:39:03.132 --> 00:39:04.843
They've got their eye on the throne.

606
00:39:04.926 --> 00:39:06.302
They're a threat to the royal family.

607
00:39:06.386 --> 00:39:08.221
They prostrated themselves

608
00:39:08.304 --> 00:39:11.975
and swore they would never again challenge
His Majesty the Emperor's authority.

609
00:39:12.058 --> 00:39:13.560
Do you even believe what you're saying?

610
00:39:13.643 --> 00:39:15.979
His Majesty's authority is so strong

611
00:39:16.062 --> 00:39:18.523
that nobody would ever dare
to challenge him at all.

612
00:39:19.357 --> 00:39:20.608
And that's what I truly believe.

613
00:39:21.609 --> 00:39:22.735
Please, sit down.

614
00:39:28.324 --> 00:39:31.244
Albani is ruthless
and you have given her free rein.

615
00:39:31.327 --> 00:39:35.248
It will be interesting to witness
what kind of wickedness she will inflict…

616
00:39:35.790 --> 00:39:37.250
and it's your responsibility.

617
00:39:37.792 --> 00:39:40.962
THE EASTERN EMPIRE'S CODE OF LAW

618
00:39:43.631 --> 00:39:45.008
So shall we begin?

619
00:39:45.592 --> 00:39:46.593
Ah.

620
00:39:46.676 --> 00:39:47.719
[footsteps approaching]

621
00:39:51.681 --> 00:39:52.682
Go ahead.

622
00:39:53.933 --> 00:39:56.185
[♪ lively music playing]

623
00:39:56.269 --> 00:39:57.604
[Kisia laughing]

624
00:39:57.687 --> 00:39:59.564
[Cherini] Lady Rashta, you must slow down!

625
00:39:59.647 --> 00:40:01.107
You should walk slowly!

626
00:40:01.190 --> 00:40:03.026
[all laughing]

627
00:40:04.402 --> 00:40:06.112
[Rashta inhales, sighs deeply]

628
00:40:09.949 --> 00:40:11.034
Ah!

629
00:40:18.958 --> 00:40:20.710
[birds chirping]

630
00:40:30.428 --> 00:40:31.888
If only that bird would come.

631
00:40:31.971 --> 00:40:33.431
She needs something to lift her spirits.

632
00:40:34.641 --> 00:40:35.808
[Verdi] I know what you mean.

633
00:40:43.524 --> 00:40:45.109
Look here,

634
00:40:45.193 --> 00:40:48.655
isn't the weather so lovely today?

635
00:40:51.407 --> 00:40:52.659
Yes, it is.

636
00:40:52.742 --> 00:40:54.118
Let's do something fun.

637
00:40:54.202 --> 00:40:56.371
We could have a walk
and a picnic on the lawn.

638
00:40:56.454 --> 00:40:58.706
-That sounds wonderful!
-Let's go out. Please?

639
00:41:01.542 --> 00:41:04.587
[Kisia] Ah! I just love
this sunshine, don't you?

640
00:41:04.671 --> 00:41:05.672
[all laughing]

641
00:41:06.297 --> 00:41:08.049
Oh, careful. Please take care!

642
00:41:08.132 --> 00:41:09.842
-[Cherini] Oh! Oh, careful, careful!
-[Kisia] Don't tear it!

643
00:41:09.926 --> 00:41:11.135
Mind your dress. Please!

644
00:41:15.598 --> 00:41:18.142
[Laura] Wow!
The weather's really beautiful today!

645
00:41:18.226 --> 00:41:20.353
-I'm so glad we came out, aren't you?
-[Kisia] My goodness!

646
00:41:20.436 --> 00:41:21.729
But that's the Empress.

647
00:41:21.813 --> 00:41:23.856
[Laura] I asked the chef to pack
one of your favorites!

648
00:41:23.940 --> 00:41:26.234
[Verdi] Will you let me have a clue,
or are you just teasing me?

649
00:41:26.317 --> 00:41:27.610
-The Empress?
-It is!

650
00:41:27.694 --> 00:41:29.445
[Laura] Ah, you'll have to wait and see!

651
00:41:31.239 --> 00:41:32.532
-Oh!
-[Kisia] Oh! Lady Rashta!

652
00:41:35.034 --> 00:41:36.411
[♪ music fades]

653
00:41:43.918 --> 00:41:45.378
Rashta, Your Majesty.

654
00:41:46.170 --> 00:41:48.423
[♪ tense music playing]

655
00:41:54.637 --> 00:41:55.722
[maid] Rashta?

656
00:41:56.556 --> 00:41:58.016
She's that sla--

657
00:41:58.599 --> 00:41:59.851
How dare she talk to us?

658
00:42:00.435 --> 00:42:03.021
I was supposed to find
His Majesty in the garden,

659
00:42:03.104 --> 00:42:04.647
now I think I've lost my way.

660
00:42:06.107 --> 00:42:08.234
We've not been introduced.

661
00:42:09.235 --> 00:42:10.236
[chuckles softly]

662
00:42:10.820 --> 00:42:14.907
I'm the one His Majesty has favored
and now I stay here in this big palace.

663
00:42:16.034 --> 00:42:17.660
[exhales] I see.

664
00:42:18.286 --> 00:42:19.537
I know who you are now.

665
00:42:20.830 --> 00:42:21.998
Oh, you do?

666
00:42:22.665 --> 00:42:24.083
I'm so glad.

667
00:42:24.167 --> 00:42:28.421
Actually, I have been wondering
when I should come and pay my respects.

668
00:42:28.504 --> 00:42:29.797
What's that?

669
00:42:29.881 --> 00:42:31.549
I did ask His Majesty,

670
00:42:31.632 --> 00:42:34.427
although he just kept telling me
I shouldn't worry.

671
00:42:36.179 --> 00:42:37.180
What a blessing!

672
00:42:37.263 --> 00:42:40.308
Since we'll be seeing each other often,
I can greet you now.

673
00:42:40.892 --> 00:42:42.894
After all, Your Majesty and I…

674
00:42:44.020 --> 00:42:46.022
we'll be joined together in this family.

675
00:42:48.649 --> 00:42:49.859
Like sisters.

676
00:42:55.740 --> 00:42:57.116
What did you just say?

677
00:42:57.200 --> 00:42:58.785
Like sisters.

678
00:42:58.868 --> 00:43:01.162
We're sharing a husband,
so that connects us.

679
00:43:09.629 --> 00:43:13.216
So could I please call you older sister?

680
00:43:13.299 --> 00:43:15.510
[chuckles softly]

681
00:43:19.555 --> 00:43:20.556
You can't.

682
00:43:29.065 --> 00:43:31.651
You're saying you don't like Rashta?

683
00:43:31.734 --> 00:43:33.820
This is not a matter of me liking you.

684
00:43:34.779 --> 00:43:36.114
In truth,

685
00:43:36.197 --> 00:43:38.449
you became His Majesty's woman,

686
00:43:38.533 --> 00:43:40.368
not my sister, isn't that so?

687
00:43:42.411 --> 00:43:43.996
In any case, you're still…

688
00:43:50.211 --> 00:43:51.379
That'll do.

689
00:43:55.716 --> 00:43:57.135
No, I didn't. Wait, just a moment.

690
00:43:57.760 --> 00:43:59.095
Don't go!

691
00:43:59.762 --> 00:44:00.763
[Navier gasps]

692
00:44:00.847 --> 00:44:01.889
[Laura gasps] Your Majesty!

693
00:44:01.973 --> 00:44:03.724
-[Cherini] Lady Rashta!
-[Laura] Goodness. Why, you!

694
00:44:03.808 --> 00:44:04.809
[Verdi] How insolent.

695
00:44:04.892 --> 00:44:06.018
[Laura] How dare you
lay your hands on her?

696
00:44:06.102 --> 00:44:07.270
How filthy!

697
00:44:13.442 --> 00:44:15.319
[Sovieshu] You call a person filthy?

698
00:44:24.203 --> 00:44:25.204
[♪ music fades]

699
00:44:26.414 --> 00:44:27.623
What's the meaning of this?

700
00:44:27.707 --> 00:44:29.333
[Rashta sobbing]

701
00:44:29.417 --> 00:44:31.043
[♪ tense music playing]

702
00:44:42.680 --> 00:44:44.015
Now, now, don't cry.

703
00:44:46.851 --> 00:44:48.227
[Rashta continues sobbing]

704
00:44:49.145 --> 00:44:50.521
[exhales] Let's go.

705
00:44:51.814 --> 00:44:53.065
It's time we left.

706
00:44:53.983 --> 00:44:55.109
[Sovieshu] Wait there.

707
00:45:00.990 --> 00:45:02.200
Leave your lady behind.

708
00:45:02.283 --> 00:45:03.743
-[Laura gasps]
-[♪ music intensifies]

709
00:45:07.330 --> 00:45:08.539
Why, what is the matter?

710
00:45:08.623 --> 00:45:09.790
Just leave her here.

711
00:45:09.874 --> 00:45:11.626
What for, Your Majesty?

712
00:45:11.709 --> 00:45:14.337
She's my lady-in-waiting,
so you need to tell me why first.

713
00:45:14.420 --> 00:45:18.007
Perhaps she is your lady-in-waiting.
She's my subject, however.

714
00:45:19.675 --> 00:45:23.137
She'll be reminded that people like her
shouldn't talk so cruelly.

715
00:45:25.181 --> 00:45:28.184
She'll be locked up for three days
with only hard bread and water.

716
00:45:28.976 --> 00:45:31.729
[sighs] Majesty, that is far too much.

717
00:45:32.730 --> 00:45:35.066
That girl tugged upon my dress.

718
00:45:35.149 --> 00:45:36.859
These ladies merely stopped her pulling.

719
00:45:36.943 --> 00:45:39.362
Empress, you call her "that girl"
when she's here.

720
00:45:39.445 --> 00:45:42.073
And what of it
if she pulled your dress a little?

721
00:45:42.823 --> 00:45:46.786
Do you think that your dress
is worth more than a person's hand?

722
00:45:50.623 --> 00:45:52.041
In that case, sire,

723
00:45:52.124 --> 00:45:54.752
my maid could easily come
and give your cloak's hem a tug.

724
00:45:54.835 --> 00:45:58.673
Perhaps retaliation
would be a more just penalty.

725
00:45:58.756 --> 00:45:59.924
I trust that you agree?

726
00:46:00.007 --> 00:46:01.342
[Sovieshu scoffs]

727
00:46:02.843 --> 00:46:05.179
You're so stubborn
that you don't give an inch.

728
00:46:06.347 --> 00:46:08.891
How would that be
in any way equivalent to this?

729
00:46:08.975 --> 00:46:10.017
It's similar.

730
00:46:10.101 --> 00:46:11.644
-No, it's not.
-Why not?

731
00:46:11.727 --> 00:46:13.562
Rashta is not a serving girl, is she?

732
00:46:14.814 --> 00:46:15.856
[exhales deeply]

733
00:46:16.649 --> 00:46:19.318
Lady Laura is a daughter of nobility.

734
00:46:19.402 --> 00:46:20.695
She can't go to prison for this!

735
00:46:21.862 --> 00:46:23.155
Five days.

736
00:46:24.240 --> 00:46:27.326
Your lady-in-waiting will serve five now.

737
00:46:40.631 --> 00:46:41.674
I'll go.

738
00:46:42.842 --> 00:46:45.177
I accept the punishment, Your Majesty.

739
00:46:51.183 --> 00:46:53.436
[♪ music continues]

740
00:47:06.073 --> 00:47:07.325
You may go.

741
00:47:16.625 --> 00:47:19.128
[♪ music crescendos]

742
00:47:19.670 --> 00:47:21.630
[breathing heavily]

743
00:47:22.840 --> 00:47:25.509
[Kisia] His Majesty
was so incredibly wonderful.

744
00:47:25.593 --> 00:47:27.470
I thought my heart would burst back there.

745
00:47:27.553 --> 00:47:28.679
[Cherini] Oh, yes, me too!

746
00:47:28.763 --> 00:47:32.016
His Majesty must truly love
Lady Rashta very much.

747
00:47:32.099 --> 00:47:34.602
-[both giggling]
-That is enough now, you two.

748
00:47:34.685 --> 00:47:35.811
I'm blushing.

749
00:47:35.895 --> 00:47:38.606
[Cherini] Well, honestly,
how could any man not be in love

750
00:47:38.689 --> 00:47:42.026
with someone who's as kind
and as beautiful and as pure as you?

751
00:47:42.109 --> 00:47:45.821
His Highness and you remind us
of two lovers in a fairytale.

752
00:47:45.905 --> 00:47:46.989
[Cherini] Mmm.

753
00:47:47.073 --> 00:47:48.074
That's right.

754
00:47:48.157 --> 00:47:50.659
Rashta is just extremely happy!

755
00:47:51.243 --> 00:47:52.745
Every day, I ask if it's all really true.

756
00:47:52.828 --> 00:47:54.497
It's real. It's all true.

757
00:47:54.580 --> 00:47:55.831
This is a miracle!

758
00:47:55.915 --> 00:47:58.667
And it could only happen
because you're the great Lady Rashta!

759
00:47:58.751 --> 00:48:01.045
Did you not see it
while we were in the garden before?

760
00:48:01.128 --> 00:48:03.172
-[Kisia] Uh-huh.
-The admiring looks in people's eyes

761
00:48:03.255 --> 00:48:06.550
as they turned around to look,
struck by Lady Rashta's beauty.

762
00:48:06.634 --> 00:48:07.843
[both squeal excitedly]

763
00:48:09.637 --> 00:48:11.138
-[Kisia] Ah, really.
-[Cherini] Yes, I mean it!

764
00:48:11.222 --> 00:48:12.681
Everyone was turning round to look.

765
00:48:12.765 --> 00:48:15.184
[Kisia] They couldn't stop staring at you.

766
00:48:15.267 --> 00:48:17.937
And girls, earlier on, did you spot this?

767
00:48:18.020 --> 00:48:21.607
Her Majesty
was shaking terribly with anger.

768
00:48:21.690 --> 00:48:23.192
[all giggling]

769
00:48:23.275 --> 00:48:24.568
[Kisia] Yes, I did.

770
00:48:24.652 --> 00:48:25.778
Although…

771
00:48:26.278 --> 00:48:28.864
this is just for your ears,
so keep this quiet,

772
00:48:28.948 --> 00:48:32.952
Her Majesty wasn't as impressive
as she thinks she is.

773
00:48:33.035 --> 00:48:34.078
Ooh!

774
00:48:34.870 --> 00:48:35.955
Mmm.

775
00:48:36.872 --> 00:48:38.290
That's bad for her.

776
00:48:40.501 --> 00:48:41.710
[chuckles softly]

777
00:48:42.503 --> 00:48:43.963
[sighs contentedly]

778
00:48:46.048 --> 00:48:47.842
[chuckles softly]

779
00:48:52.471 --> 00:48:53.722
[water running]

780
00:48:55.182 --> 00:48:56.225
[sighs]

781
00:48:56.809 --> 00:48:58.227
[sobbing]

782
00:49:01.730 --> 00:49:03.315
[bird screeches]

783
00:49:03.399 --> 00:49:04.817
[♪ uplifting music playing]

784
00:49:13.242 --> 00:49:14.410
[bird chirps]

785
00:49:14.994 --> 00:49:16.912
You always find a way to track me down.

786
00:49:28.507 --> 00:49:32.136
"The bird's name.
Is such a thing necessary?

787
00:49:33.846 --> 00:49:37.224
"If you think it is,
I would like you to decide."

788
00:49:43.105 --> 00:49:44.440
Why am I crying, you wonder?

789
00:49:45.774 --> 00:49:47.568
-[chirps]
-[sighs]

790
00:49:48.194 --> 00:49:50.446
Could it be you understood that?

791
00:49:51.489 --> 00:49:53.657
[chirping]

792
00:49:53.741 --> 00:49:55.451
[chuckles softly]

793
00:49:55.993 --> 00:49:57.119
You're so sweet.

794
00:49:57.203 --> 00:49:58.537
[chirps]

795
00:49:59.580 --> 00:50:00.998
This is like

796
00:50:01.957 --> 00:50:03.876
my own private little hideaway.

797
00:50:05.377 --> 00:50:07.338
I cannot cry anywhere else,

798
00:50:08.797 --> 00:50:11.884
but when I'm here,
I can embrace my sorrow alone.

799
00:50:18.182 --> 00:50:20.184
You know,
this place is my personal secret.

800
00:50:20.809 --> 00:50:23.979
So you are the only one
who is privy to my tears.

801
00:50:27.233 --> 00:50:28.859
[♪ gentle music playing]

802
00:50:50.923 --> 00:50:52.132
[chuckles softly]

803
00:50:57.680 --> 00:50:59.014
You are very kind.

804
00:51:00.349 --> 00:51:01.475
[chirps]

805
00:51:04.186 --> 00:51:05.604
Now your name.

806
00:51:06.730 --> 00:51:08.190
What would suit you?

807
00:51:09.692 --> 00:51:11.360
[♪ uplifting music playing]

808
00:51:13.904 --> 00:51:15.155
The bird's name…

809
00:51:20.703 --> 00:51:22.621
shall be Queen.

810
00:51:28.002 --> 00:51:29.545
Your name is decided.

811
00:51:31.255 --> 00:51:32.798
-[chirps]
-As long as…

812
00:51:33.757 --> 00:51:35.259
it's agreeable to your master.

813
00:51:39.763 --> 00:51:40.806
[chirps]

814
00:51:44.393 --> 00:51:45.436
That's right.

815
00:51:46.979 --> 00:51:48.272
I am the Empress.

816
00:51:50.107 --> 00:51:51.942
My role that I shall fulfill

817
00:51:53.902 --> 00:51:56.155
is devotion to my people
and their welfare.

818
00:51:56.739 --> 00:51:58.198
And I know that my purpose

819
00:51:59.366 --> 00:52:01.827
was never to conquer
the heart of the Emperor.

820
00:52:12.630 --> 00:52:15.341
[♪ music intensifies]

821
00:52:41.158 --> 00:52:42.910
I will not be shaken.

822
00:52:44.453 --> 00:52:46.538
Nor will I be swept away.

823
00:52:46.622 --> 00:52:48.165
[♪ music continues]

824
00:52:48.248 --> 00:52:49.249
[bird screeches]

825
00:52:52.920 --> 00:52:54.505
[bird screeches]

826
00:53:19.697 --> 00:53:24.827
THE BIRD'S NAME SHALL BE QUEEN

827
00:53:27.871 --> 00:53:30.124
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

828
00:53:30.207 --> 00:53:32.209
[♪ closing theme music playing]

